                {
                    "sender": "+1 530-555-0123",
                    "sender_name": "Emily Rose",
                    "content": "Yes, let's get extra gloves and seeds, just in case. Ben, can you handle the compost supply? I'll send a calendar invite for us to meet on Friday to purchase these items.",
