                    "content": "Sure thing, Emily. I'll handle the compost. Looking forward to a productive session!",
                    "creation_time": "2024-12-04T15:10:00",
                    "status": "sent"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "+1 530-555-0141",
                    "sender_name": "Lucas Jones",
