            "messages": [
                {
                    "sender": "+1 530-555-0123",
                    "sender_name": "Emily Rose",
                    "content": "Hi Oscar! It was great walking with you and the pets today. Got any brainstormed ideas on pet-friendly activities we could organize in the community?",
                    "creation_time": "2024-12-13T15:10:00",
                    "status": "sent"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "+1 530-555-0140",
                    "sender_name": "Oscar Martinez",
                    "content": "Hey Emily! Yes, I've been thinking about organizing a 'Paws at the Park' event where we could have agility competitions, pet-safe zones, and a corner for adoption. What do you think?",
                    "creation_time": "2024-12-13T15:15:00",
                    "status": "delivered"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "+1 530-555-0123",
                    "sender_name": "Emily Rose",
                    "content": "Love the idea, Oscar! It could really bring the community together. We could also invite local pet care vendors and have a 'Pet Tips' session.",
                    "creation_time": "2024-12-13T15:20:00",
                    "status": "read"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "+1 530-555-0140",
                    "sender_name": "Oscar Martinez",
                    "content": "Definitely! I can reach out to some vendors I know. Maybe we could run a mini training session as well?",
                    "creation_time": "2024-12-13T15:25:00",
                    "status": "delivered"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "+1 530-555-0123",
                    "sender_name": "Emily Rose",
                    "content": "Great plan! Let me know how you go with that. Once we have a draft plan, we could run it by the community board for approval.",
                    "creation_time": "2024-12-13T15:30:00",
                    "status": "read"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "+1 530-555-0140",
                    "sender_name": "Oscar Martinez",
                    "content": "Sounds good. I'll have some notes typed up this weekend and send them over. Excited to see this come to life!",
                    "creation_time": "2024-12-13T15:35:00",
                    "status": "delivered"
                },
                {
                    "sender": "+1 530-555-0123",
                    "sender_name": "Emily Rose",
                    "content": "Awesome! Thanks for your enthusiasm, Oscar. Looking forward to it!",
                    "creation_time": "2024-12-13T15:40:00",
                    "status": "read"
                }
            ]
